# View & Component Conventions

- Reusable UI → ViewComponents (`app/components/`) over partials when logic or reuse warrants it.
- Formatting logic → presenters (`app/presenters/`), not views or controllers.
- No business logic in ERB — presenters and components handle display concerns.
- Turbo Frames for partial updates; Turbo Streams for multi-target updates.
- Stimulus for client behavior — minimal JS, progressive enhancement.
- Tailwind utility classes for styling.
- Include ARIA attributes for accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA).

See also `@hotwire-frontend` for Turbo/Stimulus/Tailwind patterns.
